// Marrow, elder of the Hollow (T4.4): protective, wary. Explains the discovery risk; after SQ-07 (Tomatoes) consents to June leaving with someone she trusts.
npc: marrow
name: Marrow
start: warn [flag:hollow_doomed, !flag:hollow_warned, !flag:hollow_discovered, flag:met_marrow]
start: back [flag:met_marrow]
start: first

node: warn
  marrow (alarmed): "You have the face of someone who has done something. Say it."
  > "A raid is coming. The city has a trail to your door. You have a few hours." {flag:hollow_warned} -> warned
  > "Nothing. Never mind." -> back

node: warned
  marrow (grim): "Then we do not wait to be counted. The old tunnels, the cold stores, the children first. Bede will take the seedlings in his coat if he must. Thank you. Now go, and do not walk back down this tunnel."
  > "I am sorry." -> back

node: first
  on_enter: {flag:met_marrow}
  marrow (wary): "You came by the old tunnel. Quill vouches for you, and Quill is a poor judge of weather. Say what you came for, and then say who else knows you came."
  > "I only want to see that it is real." -> place
  > "Who else knows? Nobody." -> nobody
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: back
  marrow (wary): "You again. Sit by the fire if you must. Keep your voice down; the walls here are thinner than they look."
  > [flag:hollow_trail] "Is something wrong?" -> trail
  > "What is this place?" -> place
  > "How could it be found?" -> risk
  > [flag:sq_07_done, !flag:marrow_consent] "About the girl. June." -> june
  > [!flag:sq_07_done] "About the girl. June." -> junenot
  > [flag:marrow_consent, !flag:companion=juniper] "About June again." -> junerepeat
  > [flag:companion=juniper] "She is coming with me." -> farewell
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: nobody
  marrow (dry): "Good. Keep it that way. Everyone who has ever found us has been somebody's friend."
  > "What is this place?" -> place
  > "How could it be found?" -> risk

node: place
  marrow (wary): "A place the city forgot it had. We found a way to be cold and fed and quiet, and then to be warm. Clean water, real earth, someone to sing to. It stays real only so long as nobody counts it."
  > "How could it be found?" -> risk
  > "Thank you for telling me." -> back

node: risk
  on_enter: {+clue:hollow_discovery_risk(marrow)}
  marrow (wary): "A trail to the door, an informant with a good memory, a loud way out. A drone looking at the wrong tunnel on the wrong day. Any one of them and there will be a van, and then nothing at all."
  > "I will be careful." -> back

node: trail
  marrow (cold): "Somebody walked behind you. Not close. Close enough that I counted the minutes. Do not come here with the city watching."
  > "I am sorry." -> back

node: junenot
  marrow (flat): "June is not yours to ask about. Mend something of ours, or do something for us that costs you, and we may talk."
  > "I understand." -> back

node: june
  on_enter: {flag:marrow_consent, +clue:june_consent(marrow)}
  marrow (heavy): "Bede says you mended the pump and asked for nothing. She hums when she is frightened, you know, and she has never been frightened in her life, because I have never let her be. That will change."
  marrow (heavy): "I will let her go. Only if the Hollow stays hidden, and only with someone she trusts. If you bring a van to this door, I will not forgive it, and neither will she."
  > "I understand." -> back

node: farewell
  marrow (heavy): "Then keep her quiet, and keep her warm, and keep her away from the sort of man who writes things down. If the sky is as large as you say, tell her that the tomatoes will be waiting."
  > "I will." -> back

node: junerepeat
  marrow (heavy): "You have my word. Do not make me regret it."
  > "I will not." -> back

node: goodbye
  marrow (wary): "Mind the tunnel."
  end
